      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Linear Dy4 SMM: χMT = 56.39 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K (0.1 T), remaining nearly constant to 50 K then dropping to 37.57 cm3 K mol−1. Frequency-dependent ac susceptibility under 3 Oe ac / zero dc field; Cole–Cole α = 0.12–0.46 (5.0–16.0 K). Arrhenius fit gives ΔE/kB = 53.58 K and τ0 = 8.65 × 10−10 s, the largest barrier among 1–4.",
        "measurements": [
